7\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"24a4bd7e9143fd29\" href=\"?note=24a4bd7e9143fd29\" title=\"67-df-provability-correctness\">67-df-provability-correctness</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>左至右可证性由第一可证明性条件得到。反向利用 Prov_T 的 Σ1 复杂度、T 的 Σ1 正确性及其标准模型与外部证明的对应。文件名现准确描述这一充分条件；没有引入额外的 Feferman 完备性命题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"8c48c66841a15eb9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":